Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: Cannot take a write window into `xs`
  --> tests/ui/ownership/write_window_requires_mutable_owner_or_write_parameter_2.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     window: &xs[0]
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: An unmarked parameter gives read access only; a write window needs write access
 Fix: Change the parameter to `xs: &[Int]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
